      "fontColor": "#000000",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "borderColor": "#000000",
      "borderWidth": 1.5,
      "borderDash": "solid",
      "note": "Ostrom's game element (i): the characteristics of the actors involved, including the model of human choice adopted.\n\nSet by boundary rules: who may enter or leave. Plain question: who is in, who is out, how do you get in and out?",
      "extraLabels": [],
      "props": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "pos",
      "label": "Positions",
      "x": 450,
