      "color": "#ffffff",
      "fontColor": "#000000",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "borderColor": "#000000",
      "borderWidth": 1.5,
      "borderDash": "solid",
      "note": "Game element (ii): the positions they hold (first mover, row player; in the field, irrigator, monitor, chair).\n\nSet by position rules. Plain question: what roles exist here? Roles outlive the people in them.",
      "extraLabels": [],
      "props": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "acts",
      "label": "Actions",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 640,
